        <mxCell id="note1" value="&lt;b&gt;Read this diagram as: the doorway and the building are both standing.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Steps 1–9 are real, tested Rust. Step 10 hands off to ordo-exec, which executes it. The request pipeline is a well-specified funnel that currently terminates in Postgres." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;fontSize=12;align=left;spacingLeft=12;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
